[01:22.841]Let me show you the sights
[01:23.907]“where is the downtown babe”
[01:25.057]“I don’t know”
[01:25.462]“What”
[01:26.166]“We got 9 choose one when you ready to buy”
[01:27.793]I’m not kidding
[01:28.413]That’s just the way this city is
